810
00:54:15,723 --> 00:54:19,393
I don't want us to split up.

811
00:54:21,163 --> 00:54:23,563
I want to keep going together a little longer.

812
00:54:27,433 --> 00:54:30,403
Me neither. I don't want to split up either.

813
00:54:31,443 --> 00:54:34,413
I know it's ridiculous of me to say this...

814
00:54:35,773 --> 00:54:38,443
after being the first one to say we should quit.

815
00:54:43,183 --> 00:54:46,183
That's why I was holding back.

816
00:54:47,393 --> 00:54:49,553
Our ten years...

817
00:54:51,123 --> 00:54:53,023
I hate having them laughed at...

818
00:54:55,063 --> 00:54:56,063
like this.

819
00:54:57,263 --> 00:54:58,663
Just one last time,

820
00:54:59,903 --> 00:55:01,803
I want to try just one more time.

821
00:55:05,143 --> 00:55:06,173
Can't we?

822
00:55:10,383 --> 00:55:13,713
- Just once. - Just once.

823
00:55:13,753 --> 00:55:15,483
- Just once. - Just once.

824
00:55:15,983 --> 00:55:17,253
- Just once. - Just once.

825
00:55:17,923 --> 00:55:19,983
Why isn't this kid here yet?

826
00:55:20,493 --> 00:55:22,553
None of these punks take their boss seriously.

827
00:55:22,623 --> 00:55:23,863
I should just fire them all.

828
00:55:24,823 --> 00:55:27,263
Sir, you missed a spot here.

829
00:55:28,433 --> 00:55:29,463
Darn it.

830
00:55:32,033 --> 00:55:33,063
I won't do it again.

831
00:55:35,973 --> 00:55:37,003
I'm sorry.

832
00:55:38,173 --> 00:55:39,303
Wipe that smirk off your face.

833
00:55:39,373 --> 00:55:41,113
It's annoying.

834
00:55:42,843 --> 00:55:43,883
By the way, sir,

835
00:55:45,043 --> 00:55:46,443
how did you know I was there?

836
00:55:50,883 --> 00:55:52,183
You knew from the beginning, didn't you?

837
00:55:53,853 --> 00:55:54,923
How bad I was.

838
00:55:57,163 --> 00:55:58,863
That's why you set me up with them, right?

839
00:56:00,363 --> 00:56:01,593
Because they're good kids,

840
00:56:02,733 --> 00:56:04,303
you knew they'd take me in.

841
00:56:06,103 --> 00:56:09,133
From what I've seen in life, not everyone is born...

842
00:56:09,203 --> 00:56:10,703
where they rightly belong.

843
00:56:11,973 --> 00:56:14,513
I set you up, sure, but you chose to fit in with them.

844
00:56:15,643 --> 00:56:16,943
That was where you belonged.

845
00:56:19,183 --> 00:56:21,183
You're a good kid too, you punk.

846
00:56:21,853 --> 00:56:23,213
It's not just them.

847
00:56:30,023 --> 00:56:31,023
Mr. Jung.

848
00:56:37,833 --> 00:56:40,303
You need to wipe down all of this water again.

849
00:56:40,633 --> 00:56:41,633
What will you do with all this water?

850
00:56:41,703 --> 00:56:44,403
What are you even wiping?

851
00:56:45,003 --> 00:56:46,243
Seriously.

852
00:56:48,613 --> 00:56:49,613
Gosh.

853
00:56:49,673 --> 00:56:51,343
So Tae Gu still hasn't come around?

854
00:56:53,243 --> 00:56:55,283
Yes. Well, it was a hard decision for him to make,

855
00:56:55,783 --> 00:56:57,183
so reversing it must not be easy.

856
00:56:59,183 --> 00:57:01,153
You know how stubborn he can be.

857
00:57:03,863 --> 00:57:04,863
Still,

858
00:57:06,723 --> 00:57:08,093
I'm going to wait for him until the end.

859
00:57:12,733 --> 00:57:14,603
We always eat nothing but junk food.

860
00:57:14,673 --> 00:57:16,273
Let's eat something else for a change.

861
00:57:16,333 --> 00:57:17,873
Yes, let's get some meat.

862
00:57:18,243 --> 00:57:19,243
Let's do that.

863
00:57:19,403 --> 00:57:20,413
- When? - When?

864
00:57:21,273 --> 00:57:24,713
- Later. - Man, what a buzz kill.

865
00:57:24,713 --> 00:57:26,483
Green onions are more expensive these days.

866
00:57:26,713 --> 00:57:27,983
What is this? Hey, you...

867
00:57:28,883 --> 00:57:30,323
Hey, what should we have for dinner tonight?

868
00:57:31,153 --> 00:57:32,753
- Hey! - Yes?

869
00:57:32,823 --> 00:57:34,423
I told you not to waste toilet paper!

870
00:57:35,553 --> 00:57:37,993
- He started it! - Did I not tell you not to use it?

871
00:57:38,063 --> 00:57:39,463
- Hey, Jun Seo, look at this. - I told you to stop!

872
00:57:39,523 --> 00:57:41,693
- Hey, look at this. Look. - What is that? Who was it?

873
00:57:41,763 --> 00:57:43,703
- It was him. - Who was it? Who?

874
00:57:43,763 --> 00:57:45,503
- Was it you? Who was it? - It was not me.

875
00:57:45,563 --> 00:57:46,633
No, I did not do that at all.

876
00:57:49,973 --> 00:57:51,073
Hey.

877
00:57:54,613 --> 00:57:56,613
Hey, are you not going to clean?

878
00:57:56,873 --> 00:57:59,443
- I won the bet. - What bet?

879
00:58:00,353 --> 00:58:04,953
All right, here you go. Careful, it is hot.

880
00:58:08,653 --> 00:58:10,693
- That is fun. - You think so?

881
00:58:13,393 --> 00:58:14,633
It tastes a bit strange.

882
00:58:15,693 --> 00:58:17,863
Hey, no one could be as desperate as you.

883
00:58:18,503 --> 00:58:20,273
Were you not rejected by Na Yeon a hundred times?

884
00:58:20,303 --> 00:58:21,733
It was 99... Oh, come on.

885
00:58:24,743 --> 00:58:26,343
- What are you doing? - What do I do?

886
00:58:26,403 --> 00:58:28,273
Let us do that. Hey, let us use that later.

887
00:58:30,813 --> 00:58:34,553
Hey, Jun Seo, can you see my underwear?

888
00:58:35,383 --> 00:58:36,383
- No. - Is it okay? Am I good?

889
00:58:36,453 --> 00:58:37,523
Yes, you are fine.

890
00:58:37,583 --> 00:58:39,023
- Are you sure? - Yes.

891
00:58:39,183 --> 00:58:40,653
Hey, what was that bit we changed?

892
00:58:41,193 --> 00:58:42,453
When I point to the seats on the left...

893
00:58:42,523 --> 00:58:44,263
- When you point left. - The seats.

894
00:58:44,323 --> 00:58:46,623
- When I point there. - Okay. Got it.

895
00:58:46,693 --> 00:58:48,093
- Okay. Got it. - Okay.

896
00:58:50,863 --> 00:58:53,533
- Let's go. All right. - Guys.

897
00:58:53,563 --> 00:58:54,603
- Pardon? - You are up next.

898
00:58:54,873 --> 00:58:56,233
- Okay, let us go. - Let us go.

899
00:59:00,273 --> 00:59:01,273
Guys.

900
00:59:06,343 --> 00:59:07,383
Is it...

901
00:59:12,523 --> 00:59:13,523
really okay?

902
00:59:17,393 --> 00:59:18,493
Of course it is, you idiot.

903
00:59:29,533 --> 00:59:30,543
Then...

904
00:59:33,003 --> 00:59:34,343
I want to try one more time.

905
00:59:39,683 --> 00:59:40,753
Let us take it all the way.

906
00:59:43,053 --> 00:59:44,053
Together.

907
00:59:53,363 --> 00:59:55,233
What? Let go! Stop it, I said!

908
00:59:55,593 --> 00:59:56,893
Was it really that hard on you?

909
00:59:57,663 --> 00:59:59,703
- Come on, please? - You little punk.

910
00:59:59,763 --> 01:00:02,733
- Hey, are we doing the show or not? - You were crying, were you not?

911
01:00:02,873 --> 01:00:04,103
- I was not. - You totally cried.

912
01:00:04,173 --> 01:00:05,743
- I said I did not cry! - He cried. I saw him cry.

913
01:00:05,873 --> 01:00:07,313
- You saw what? - I saw you.

914
01:00:07,343 --> 01:00:09,113
- You are tearing up. - I am not crying. It is too spicy,

915
01:00:09,173 --> 01:00:10,173
