916
01:00:10,243 --> 01:00:12,283
- Give me a break. Spicy, my foot. - I did not cry, jerk.

917
01:00:18,583 --> 01:00:19,583
Hey, Ji Young.

918
01:00:19,653 --> 01:00:21,293
Eun Young, you will not believe this.

919
01:00:21,353 --> 01:00:23,423
I just heard from Uncle Man Sik.

920
01:00:30,033 --> 01:00:31,033
Where are you going?

921
01:00:37,143 --> 01:00:39,743
Hey, so what should we do first?

922
01:00:39,773 --> 01:00:41,573
What do you mean? Write jokes, of course.

923
01:00:42,173 --> 01:00:44,083
We're pitching a new sketch next week.

924
01:00:44,443 --> 01:00:45,443
Get ready.

925
01:00:47,483 --> 01:00:50,113
You persistent jerk. Why are you so relentless?

926
01:00:50,583 --> 01:00:51,823
That hurts.

927
01:00:54,193 --> 01:00:57,193
Darn it, that hurts, you guys!

928
01:01:01,593 --> 01:01:02,993
Did you think I'd chicken out?

929
01:01:04,633 --> 01:01:06,063
Stop it, seriously.

930
01:01:16,013 --> 01:01:17,613
What is wrong with you?

931
01:01:17,683 --> 01:01:18,943
(Soojung Villa)

932
01:01:25,323 --> 01:01:26,323
What?

933
01:01:26,783 --> 01:01:28,123
Did you run all the way here like that?

934
01:02:53,443 --> 01:02:57,143
(Happy Anding)

935
01:02:57,483 --> 01:02:59,513
Since when did it start?

936
01:02:59,583 --> 01:03:02,953
Hey, since when were you two a thing?

937
01:03:03,083 --> 01:03:05,853
I really just did that as a pure fan.

938
01:03:05,923 --> 01:03:07,083
I swear...

939
01:03:07,153 --> 01:03:11,423
- I had zero ulterior motives... - Eun Young has become...

940
01:03:11,423 --> 01:03:12,593
our fan club president.

941
01:03:12,723 --> 01:03:16,793
When we're all together like that, it's fun and comforting.

942
01:03:16,993 --> 01:03:18,563
What did you and Jun Seo talk about?

943
01:03:19,033 --> 01:03:20,333
Just...

944
01:03:20,403 --> 01:03:21,873
that he likes me.

945
01:03:22,003 --> 01:03:23,973
(Generative AI Used In Select Scenes)
